Package: finalproject
Title: Public Health Data Analyses for BST260 (NHANES and US Firearm Mortality)
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yizhe",
           family = "Dai",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "yizhedai@hsph.harvard.edu")
Description: Final project for HSPH BST260, Fall 2026. The package
    documents two analyses of public health data: physical activity and
    systolic blood pressure among US adults in NHANES, and state firearm
    legislation in relation to firearm mortality using RAND and CDC data.
    Results are presented as vignettes on a pkgdown site.
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
Suggests: knitr, testthat, rmarkdown, pkgdown, quarto, NHANES, dplyr,
    ggplot2
License: Artistic-2.0
VignetteBuilder: quarto
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/ChrisyzD/finalproject, https://chrisyzd.github.io/finalproject
BugReports: https://github.com/ChrisyzD/finalproject/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Roxygen: list(markdown=TRUE)
